From 6abd5e2d09f98c1a7c7ca5a06823e06d36071c2a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Kuraev <naoru.desu@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 18:42:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: clean up DPU encoders on
 display handoff

Add kernel patches 0125-0126 to track encoder mixers and release command-mode display resources. Advance to release 84.
---
 ...che-layer-mixers-for-encoder-cleanup.patch | 128 ++++++++++++++++++
 ...n-up-command-mode-encoder-on-disable.patch |  61 +++++++++
 .../linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250/APKBUILD   |   6 +-
 3 files changed, 194 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 device/testing/linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250/0125-drm-msm-dpu-cache-layer-mixers-for-encoder-cleanup.patch
